241 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 108 0 R
/E (Payroll teams must consider these expectations in relation to their own staff, improving their employee retention strategies to include more flexible working opportunities. Organisations that cannot offer their own payroll staff flexibility in how, when, and where they work will struggle to hire and retain the people who keep everything running.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
